Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 13:02:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(rules): Firestore + Storage security rules, indexes,
 firebase.json

- firestore.rules: auth-gated; owners cannot write money/state fields;
  wallet ledger/payments/calls/audit are server-write-only; participant-only
  chat; admin-restricted reports & verification docs; default deny
- storage.rules: per-user scoped paths; verification docs admin-read-only;
  content-type + size limits
- firestore.indexes.json: composite/collection-group indexes for wallet,
  chat, requests, reports, calls, verification, notifications
- firebase.json: wire firestore rules+indexes and storage rules
